+
+def set_job_cast(job_dir, ids):
+    """Choose the saved characters of a job that has not planned its scenes yet (v7.0.122).
+
+    A job made from a prepared narration batch holds no cast, so its storyboard invents a new person even
+    though the user saved a character. Writing the same snapshots Create writes means the next Resume plans
+    that exact character. A job whose storyboard already exists keeps the identity its shots were planned
+    with - its shots carry the reference photos they were compiled for, so changing the cast now would be a
+    silently different video.
